## Charlotte’s truck wheel alignment experts

Uneven tire wear, or a truck pulling to one side? Alignment is the work this
shop is known for. Very few shops in the area can put a tractor on a rack and
measure the drive axles against the chassis centerline, and that measurement is
the one that decides whether a combination rolls straight or drags sideways.

## Heavy-duty truck and fleet suspension repair

A bumpy ride is a symptom. Leaf springs, shocks, bushings and air suspension all
fail gradually, and the suspension is what holds the tires on the road — which
makes it a safety system before it is a comfort one.

## About Eagle Span Corporation

Your trucks are how the business moves, so the repair has to be right the first
time. We work on heavy-duty vehicles and commercial fleets, with alignment and
suspension as the specialty and the tools and diagnostic equipment to back the
rest of the list.

Quality service speaks for itself. With a focus on alignment, DOT inspections,
suspension, tires and battery work, our diesel mechanics solve the complicated
problems and get vehicles back on the road safely, across Charlotte, NC.

{% callout tone="note" title="National account services" %}
We accept national account service through Michelin, Bridgestone and Yokohama.
Fleet billing and scheduling are on the [fleet service](/fleet) page.
